

ISSUES Without MVC :
One big JS file
  All routes and logic are in one file. Hard to read and maintain.
Large apps have many route methods
  Example: login routes, product routes, admin routes, survey routes. They should be grouped separately.
Need modular controllers and route mappings
  Route decides URL.
  Controller handles what to do.
Need proper data sharing
  Use Variable scopes: 
    Application scope variable = data shared across whole app, like products and surveyresults.
    Request scope variable = data only for one request, like req.body.gender
    Session scope =server-side memory for one client across multiple requests. check below 
No separated model yet
  Data logic is not separated.
  In MVC, model should handle data/database.


