SESSION
Eg. logged in user stays logged in across many page 
(implememnted using module: express-session)
      req.session stores session scope data -> persists across mutiple requests from same browser 
Eg2 Requirement : A user should not vote more than once within a certain time using the same browser.
Solution:
Store user’s previous vote in session.
Logic:
User submits vote. Check if req.session.vote already exists.
If yes, ignore new vote. If no, save vote in session and update results.

